# Generated video outputs. The small curated showcase clips are intentional.
*.mp4
!showcase/lateact_demo.mp4
!showcase/source_clips/*.mp4

# Temporary/local serving output
site_review/
paper/build/
*.log
*.tmp
*.pid
nohup.out

# Recovery-critical JSON/CSV, paper source/PDF, patches, and vendored source are
# deliberately not ignored. Large generated MP4/latent trees remain external.
